    "title": "Add servo support to transpiler and code generation",
    "body": "## Summary\n- add Servo AST nodes to represent declarations and write operations\n- extend the parser to recognize Servo usage, expose read helpers, and avoid conflicts with other `.write` calls\n- update the emitter to track servo calibration/state, emit Servo.h usage, and generate the appropriate C++\n- cover the new behaviour with parser and emitter tests for servo scenarios\n\n## Testing\n- pytest\n\n------\nhttps://chatgpt.com/codex/tasks/task_e_6906158a2fac832693e0112dbd17fb76",
